Feature: PATCH /api/notes/{id} sets the done flag for the signed-in owner
  As a signed-in note owner
  I want to set a note's done flag to true or false via PATCH /api/notes/{id}
  So that I can mark notes complete or re-open them and see the updated note without a follow-up GET

  Background:
    Given a note with id "note-1" owned by the signed-in user with done flag false

  # Why: Core path — the owner completes a note and receives the updated note back
