    Given a note with id "note-1" owned by the signed-in user with done flag false
    When the signed-in owner sends PATCH /api/notes/note-1 with done set to true
    Then the request should succeed
    And the returned note should have id "note-1"
    And the returned note should have done flag true

  # Why: Core path — the owner re-opens a completed note and receives the updated note back
